<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney cuts oil stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney cuts oil stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney analyst David Wheeler said he downgraded a group of oil and exploration companies.</p>
<p>-- reduced Belco Oil &amp; Gas Corp and Vintage Petroleum Inc to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- cut Devon Energy Corp and Enserch Exploration Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Wheeler declined other comment.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, Enserch closed off 1/8 to 10-3/4, Belco fell 3/4 to 23-1/4, Vintage was off 3/4 to 34-5/8, and Devon was off 15/16 to 36-1/16.</p>
</text>
